    "No direct ubiquinone/CoQ10 oral bioavailability data in the evidence set.",
    "No data on the effect of the quinone head on absorption of long-chain isoprenoids.",
    "The high phytoene value is from a single study using a labeled compound and compartmental modeling, which may not generalize."
  ],
